OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly cloudy day with patchy
OL,6,Frain spreading across the southeast,
OL,7,Fbest chance of brighter conditions
OL,8,Faround the Antrim coast. Chance of a
OL,9,Fheavier shower later in the west.
OL,10,FLight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSome heavier showers
OL,13,Fdeveloping during the evening,
OL,14,Fespecially in the south, becoming
OL,15,Fdrier towards dawn with some clear
OL,16,Fspells later, light winds.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FA bright start on Sunday with
OL,19,Fsome sunshine in the morning, risk of
OL,20,Fheavy showers in the afternoon with a
OL,21,Frumble of thunder possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
