OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,6,Flittle brighter on Monday and Tuesday
OL,7,Fbut still showery at times, windier
OL,8,Ftoo. Uncertainty for Wednesday but a
OL,9,Frisk of some wet and windy weather.
